# The end of the Nod campaign, with the last mission won by the developers'
# Alt-W: after the score and the hall of fame, the four cities to fire the
# ion cannon at. A click above the pictures chooses nothing, a click on one
# does; then the picture that announces the next game, and the main menu. The
# movies between them are off.
# args: -PLAYTEST -NEWGAMESCB13EA
at 300 keydown ALT
at 301 key W
at 305 keyup ALT
at 3001 type AB
at 3020 key RETURN
at 3300 shot select_a_target
at 3301 click 480 20
at 3400 shot still_selecting
at 3401 click 480 300
at 3500 shot coming_attraction
at 4100 shot main_menu
at 4101 quit
